    "Id": "event_argo_bought",
    "Name": "A Ship of Our Own",
    "Details": "Yang waves you over with a datapad full of lien certificates and a grin he can't quite suppress. 'Boss, you know I've been haunting the breaker yards since spring. Well — Perifax Salvage is liquidating, and they've got an old Explorer-class hull on the ledger. Stripped to the ribs and cold as a tomb, but the frame is true and the price... the price is a steal. ¢2,000,000 and she's ours.'\n\nDarius whistles quietly at the tonnage figures. 'An office with actual doors, Commander.'",
